OL,3,GNEWSACourt action considered over
OL,4,Aderelict Debenhams
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is considering getting courts
OL,7,Finvolved to force the owners of a
OL,8,Fderelict former Debenhams building to
OL,9,Fbetter secure it.
OL,11,FThe landmark building in the heart of
OL,12,FNottingham has been repeatedly broken
OL,13,Finto by youths, who have been spotted
OL,14,Fon the roof, on one occasion allegedly
OL,15,Fthrowing bricks.
OL,17,FNottingham City Council has said it is
OL,18,Flooking into seeking an injunction to
OL,19,Fmake the owners, Long Row Properties,
OL,20,Ftry harder to stop this - or be in
OL,21,Fcontempt of court.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
