OL,3,GNEWSACourt action considered over
OL,4,Aderelict Debenhams
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Tuckett, at Longmead Capital, which
OL,7,Fmanages the building on behalf of the
OL,8,Fowners, said: "Preventing anyone from
OL,9,Fputting themselves at risk is our
OL,10,Fpriority."
